# Nothing goes into a build context unless it is named here, so a .env file or a local note never
# reaches an image.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!config
!packages
!apps

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/CLAUDE.md
**/*.tsbuildinfo
